<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Right Here In My Arms</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">HIM</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Razorblade Romance</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4R6ixj4SsrNjxZz6uCwYlg</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.310" end="00:10.310" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.790" end="00:37.600">She is smiling like heaven is down on earth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.600" end="00:43.400" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.400" end="00:49.090">The sun is shining so bright on her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.090" end="00:55.030" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.030" end="01:00.700">And all her wishes have finally come true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.700" end="01:03.400" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.400" end="01:11.400">And her heart is weeping, coz' happiness is killing her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.160" end="01:13.660" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.280" end="01:17.460">It's close she's in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.460" end="01:21.390">She'll be right here in my arms so in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.390" end="01:23.330" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.330" end="01:29.780">She'll be right here in these arms she can't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.780" end="01:35.580">She'll be right here in my arms so in Love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.580" end="01:41.510">She'll be right here in these arms she can't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.510" end="01:43.010" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.320" end="01:43.820">Oh no..</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.700" end="01:49.440" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.440" end="01:50.940">So hard she's trying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.620" end="01:52.250" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.250" end="01:54.550">But her heart won't turn to stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.550" end="01:57.170" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.170" end="01:58.670">Oh no..</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.350" end="02:01.290" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.290" end="02:03.040">And she keeps on crying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.040" end="02:04.540" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.100" end="02:06.280">Coz' I won't leave her alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.280" end="02:08.340" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.340" end="02:11.090">She'll never be alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.090" end="02:12.590" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.650" end="02:17.950">She'll be right here in my arms so in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.950" end="02:23.940">She'll be right here in these arms she can't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.940" end="02:28.740">She'll be right here in my arms so in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.740" end="02:30.240" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.870" end="02:35.550">She'll be right here in these arms she can't golet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.550" end="02:43.550" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.910" end="03:17.220">And she'll be right here in my arms so in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.220" end="03:18.720" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.970" end="03:23.100">She'll be right here in these arms she can't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.100" end="03:24.600" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.660" end="03:29.960">She'll be right here in my arms so in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.960" end="03:34.080">She'll be right here in these arms she can't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.080" end="03:42.080" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:57.200" end="04:01.200">Oh Noooo!</p></div></body></tt>